        <h2>📚 Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        
        <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <h3>How do I add the bot to my server?</h3>
            <p>Click the "Add to Discord" button on our homepage and follow the authorization process. Make sure you have "Manage Server" permissions.</p>
            
            <h3>Are the coins real money?</h3>
            <p>No! All coins in ATIVE Casino Bot are virtual and for entertainment only. They have no real-world value and cannot be exchanged for real money.</p>
            
            <h3>How do I earn coins?</h3>
            <p>You can earn coins by:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Using <code>/work</code> command (available every few hours)</li>
                <li>Claiming <code>/daily</code> bonuses</li>
                <li>Winning casino games</li>
                <li>Participating in events and tournaments</li>
            </ul>
            
            <h3>What if I lose all my coins?</h3>
            <p>Don't worry! You can always earn more coins through the /work and /daily commands. We also have safety features to prevent you from losing everything at once.</p>
            
            <h3>Is the bot safe for my server?</h3>
            <p>Yes! ATIVE Casino Bot only requests necessary permissions and follows Discord's Terms of Service. We don't store personal messages or sensitive data.</p>
            
            <h3>How do I report a bug?</h3>
            <p>Join our support server or use the <code>/support</code> command to get links for reporting bugs and issues.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

